    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon660_Carbuncle_02:Summon660_Carbuncle_02_007:b5db33f2",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_Summon660_Carbuncle_02",
        "key": "Summon660_Carbuncle_02_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon660_Carbuncle_02:Summon660_Carbuncle_02_007:b5db33f2",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon660_Carbuncle_02:Summon660_Carbuncle_02_007:b5db33f2",
        "jp_sha256": "faf9851c8065fd4f500f5006b9586ac78a1d8800a10f13b95418e18376a041e6",
        "official_en_sha256": "ac4d251c73e4ce7ee6cb6ea6c7baf8a0b2bfe384f348738723fc22927795f659"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "順番にってことだから……。\r\n「水都の南東、大きな水と小さな水を両手にする」から\r\n調べてみるか。",
        "official_en": "It says to find them in order, so...we’ll need to start with the one that “holds the big and small ponds in both hands.” It should be southeast of the aquapolis.",
        "real_en": "It says to find them in order... Let's start with the clue about the first one: 'southeast of the water city, holding the large and small waters in both hands.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
